{
 "version": 1,
 "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-6",
 "asignatura": "matematicas",
 "anio": 2015,
 "convocatoria": "Reserva 6",
 "documento": "MAT-2015-RESERVA_6.pdf",
 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-6-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Halla \\(a\\) y \\(b\\) sabiendo que es continua la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida como \\(f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{x+\\cos(x)-ae^x}{x^2}&\\text{si }x\\neq0\\\\b&\\text{si }x=0\\end{cases}\\)",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Fuera de \\(x=0\\), \\(f\\) es continua (cociente de continuas con denominador no nulo). Es continua en \\(x=0\\) si \\(\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}f(x)=f(0)=b\\), así que el límite tiene que ser finito.</p><p>El denominador tiende a 0 y el numerador a \\(0+1-a=1-a\\). Si \\(1-a\\neq0\\), el límite sería infinito<i class='n' data-t='why'>Un número distinto de cero dividido entre algo que tiende a 0 da infinito: el límite no sería finito.</i>: \\(\\boxed{a=1}\\). Con \\(a=1\\) es \\(\\frac00\\) y aplico la regla de L'Hôpital<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>:</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{x+\\cos x-e^x}{x^2}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{1-\\mathrm{sen}\\,x-e^x}{2x}=\\left[\\frac00\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{-\\cos x-e^x}2=-1\\]<p>Por tanto \\(\\boxed{b=-1}\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=1\\), \\(b=-1\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "cont",
     "apartados": ""
    },
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "lim",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": "MAT-2015-RESERVA_6.pdf"
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "borrador"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-6-2",
   "n": 2,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=|\\ln(x)|\\) para \\(x\\gt0\\) (\\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano).",
    "apartados": [
     "(0,5 p.) Esboza el recinto limitado por la gráfica de \\(f\\) y la recta \\(y=1\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Calcula los puntos de corte de la gráfica de \\(f\\) con la recta \\(y=1\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula el área del recinto citado."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(\\ln x\\lt0\\) si \\(0\\lt x\\lt1\\) y \\(\\ln x\\ge0\\) si \\(x\\ge1\\):</p>\\[f(x)=|\\ln x|=\\begin{cases}-\\ln x&\\text{si }0\\lt x\\lt1\\\\\\ln x&\\text{si }x\\ge1\\end{cases}\\]<p>Es la gráfica de \\(\\ln x\\) con el trozo de \\((0,1)\\) reflejado hacia arriba; toca el eje en \\((1,0)\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 190' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='58.9,74.5 60.9,74.5 62.9,74.5 64.9,74.5 66.9,74.5 68.9,74.5 70.9,74.5 72.9,74.5 74.9,74.5 76.9,74.5 79.0,74.5 81.0,74.5 83.0,74.5 85.0,74.5 87.0,74.5 89.0,74.5 91.0,74.5 93.0,74.5 95.0,74.5 97.0,74.5 99.1,74.5 101.1,74.5 103.1,74.5 105.1,74.5 107.1,74.5 109.1,74.5 111.1,74.5 113.1,74.5 115.1,74.5 117.2,74.5 119.2,74.5 121.2,74.5 123.2,74.5 125.2,74.5 127.2,74.5 129.2,74.5 131.2,74.5 133.2,74.5 135.2,74.5 137.3,74.5 139.3,74.5 141.3,74.5 143.3,74.5 145.3,74.5 147.3,74.5 149.3,74.5 151.3,74.5 153.3,74.5 155.3,74.5 157.4,74.5 159.4,74.5 161.4,74.5 163.4,74.5 165.4,74.5 167.4,74.5 169.4,74.5 171.4,74.5 173.4,74.5 175.4,74.5 177.5,74.5 179.5,74.5 181.5,74.5 183.5,74.5 185.5,74.5 187.5,74.5 189.5,74.5 191.5,74.5 193.5,74.5 195.5,74.5 197.6,74.5 199.6,74.5 201.6,74.5 203.6,74.5 205.6,74.5 207.6,74.5 209.6,74.5 211.6,74.5 213.6,74.5 215.7,74.5 217.7,74.5 219.7,74.5 219.7,74.5 217.7,75.3 215.7,76.0 213.6,76.8 211.6,77.6 209.6,78.3 207.6,79.1 205.6,79.9 203.6,80.7 201.6,81.5 199.6,82.3 197.6,83.2 195.5,84.0 193.5,84.9 191.5,85.7 189.5,86.6 187.5,87.5 185.5,88.4 183.5,89.3 181.5,90.2 179.5,91.2 177.5,92.1 175.4,93.1 173.4,94.0 171.4,95.0 169.4,96.0 167.4,97.0 165.4,98.1 163.4,99.1 161.4,100.2 159.4,101.3 157.4,102.4 155.3,103.5 153.3,104.6 151.3,105.8 149.3,107.0 147.3,108.1 145.3,109.4 143.3,110.6 141.3,111.9 139.3,113.2 137.3,114.5 135.2,115.8 133.2,117.2 131.2,118.6 129.2,120.0 127.2,121.4 125.2,122.9 123.2,124.4 121.2,126.0 119.2,127.6 117.2,129.2 115.1,130.8 113.1,132.5 111.1,134.3 109.1,136.1 107.1,137.9 105.1,139.8 103.1,141.8 101.1,141.7 99.1,139.6 97.0,137.5 95.0,135.3 93.0,133.0 91.0,130.7 89.0,128.2 87.0,125.7 85.0,123.1 83.0,120.4 81.0,117.5 79.0,114.6 76.9,111.5 74.9,108.2 72.9,104.8 70.9,101.2 68.9,97.5 66.9,93.4 64.9,89.2 62.9,84.6 60.9,79.8 58.9,74.5' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='47.4,33.0 49.2,41.8 51.1,49.6 53.0,56.5 54.9,62.9 56.8,68.7 58.7,74.0 60.5,79.0 62.4,83.6 64.3,87.9 66.2,92.0 68.1,95.8 69.9,99.4 71.8,102.9 73.7,106.2 75.6,109.3 77.5,112.3 79.4,115.2 81.2,117.9 83.1,120.6 85.0,123.1 86.9,125.6 88.8,127.9 90.6,130.2 92.5,132.4 94.4,134.6 96.3,136.7 98.2,138.7 100.1,140.7 101.9,142.6 103.8,141.0 105.7,139.2 107.6,137.5 109.5,135.8 111.3,134.1 113.2,132.5 115.1,130.9 117.0,129.3 118.9,127.8 120.7,126.3 122.6,124.8 124.5,123.4 126.4,122.0 128.3,120.6 130.2,119.3 132.0,118.0 133.9,116.7 135.8,115.4 137.7,114.2 139.6,113.0 141.4,111.8 143.3,110.6 145.2,109.4 147.1,108.3 149.0,107.2 150.9,106.0 152.7,105.0 154.6,103.9 156.5,102.8 158.4,101.8 160.3,100.8 162.1,99.8 164.0,98.8 165.9,97.8 167.8,96.8 169.7,95.9 171.6,95.0 173.4,94.0 175.3,93.1 177.2,92.2 179.1,91.3 181.0,90.5 182.8,89.6 184.7,88.7 186.6,87.9 188.5,87.1 190.4,86.2 192.3,85.4 194.1,84.6 196.0,83.8 197.9,83.0 199.8,82.3 201.7,81.5 203.5,80.7 205.4,80.0 207.3,79.2 209.2,78.5 211.1,77.8 212.9,77.1 214.8,76.3 216.7,75.6 218.6,74.9 220.5,74.3 222.4,73.6 224.2,72.9 226.1,72.2 228.0,71.6 229.9,70.9 231.8,70.3 233.6,69.6 235.5,69.0 237.4,68.3 239.3,67.7 241.2,67.1 243.1,66.5 244.9,65.9 246.8,65.3 248.7,64.7 250.6,64.1 252.5,63.5 254.3,62.9 256.2,62.3 258.1,61.7 260.0,61.2 261.9,60.6 263.8,60.0 265.6,59.5 267.5,58.9 269.4,58.4 271.3,57.8 273.2,57.3' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='20.0,74.5 150.0,74.5 280.0,74.5' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='58.9' cy='74.5' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='38.9' y='60.5'>(1/e, 1)</text><circle cx='219.7' cy='74.5' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='223.7' y='66.5'>(e, 1)</text><text x='238.9' y='50.7' fill='#2f6df0' font-size='12'>f</text><text x='119.2' y='67.7' fill='#f0a30a' font-size='10'>y = 1</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 142.7H294.0M33.7 184.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='102.1' y1='139.7' x2='102.1' y2='145.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='99.1' y='156.7' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='170.5' y1='139.7' x2='170.5' y2='145.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='167.5' y='156.7' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='238.9' y1='139.7' x2='238.9' y2='145.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='235.9' y='156.7' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='30.7' y1='74.5' x2='36.7' y2='74.5' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='17.7' y='78.5' font-size='10'>1</text></svg></div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(-\\ln x=1\\iff x=\\frac1e\\) (en \\((0,1)\\)); \\(\\ln x=1\\iff x=e\\) (en \\([1,+\\infty)\\)).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\left(\\frac1e,1\\right)\\) y \\((e,1)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta queda por encima de \\(f\\) entre \\(\\frac1e\\) y \\(e\\). Separo en \\(x=1\\) y uso \\(\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x\\) (por partes):</p>\\[\\int_{1/e}^1(1+\\ln x)\\,dx=\\bigl[x\\ln x\\bigr]_{1/e}^1=0-\\frac1e(-1)=\\frac1e\\]\\[\\int_1^e(1-\\ln x)\\,dx=\\bigl[2x-x\\ln x\\bigr]_1^e=e-2\\]\\[A=\\frac1e+e-2\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=e+\\dfrac1e-2\\approx1{,}086\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
