  {
   "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-6-3",
   "n": 3,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la matriz \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&m\\\\m-1&0&2\\\\0&1-m&0\\end{pmatrix}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,75 p.) Halla el valor, o valores, de \\(m\\) para los que la matriz \\(A\\) tiene rango 2.",
     "(0,75 p.) Para \\(m=1\\), determina \\(A^{2015}\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Para que el rango sea 2, el determinante tiene que ser 0. Por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}0&1&m\\\\m-1&0&2\\\\0&1-m&0\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(0+0- m^{3} + 2 m^{2} - m\\bigr)-\\bigl(0+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-m(m-1)^2\\]\\[|A|=0\\iff m=0\\ \\text{ o }\\ m=1\\]<p><b>• </b>\\(m=0\\)<b>:</b> \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&0\\\\-1&0&2\\\\0&1&0\\end{pmatrix}\\), con \\(\\begin{vmatrix}0&1\\\\-1&0\\end{vmatrix}=1\\neq0\\): rango 2.</p><p><b>• </b>\\(m=1\\)<b>:</b> \\(A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1&1\\\\0&0&2\\\\0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\), con \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\0&2\\end{vmatrix}=2\\neq0\\): rango 2.</p><p>Si \\(m\\neq0,1\\), \\(|A|\\neq0\\) y el rango es 3.</p><div class='res'>\\(m=0\\) o \\(m=1\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Calculo las primeras potencias:</p>\\[A^2=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1 & 1\\\\0 & 0 & 2\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1 & 1\\\\0 & 0 & 2\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 2\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad A^3=A^2A=\\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\]<p>Como \\(A^3=O\\), todas las potencias siguientes son nulas<i class='n' data-t='why'>\\(A^n=A^3\\cdot A^{n-3}=O\\cdot A^{n-3}=O\\) para \\(n\\ge3\\).</i>.</p><div class='res'>\\(A^{2015}=O\\) (la matriz nula)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "matrices",
     "tipo": "rango",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
