  {
   "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-6-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean los planos \\(\\pi\\equiv x+3y+2z-5=0\\) y \\(\\pi'\\equiv-2x+y+3z+3=0\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Determina el ángulo que forman \\(\\pi\\) y \\(\\pi'\\).",
     "(1 p.) Calcula el volumen del tetraedro limitado por \\(\\pi\\) y los planos coordenados."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El ángulo entre dos planos es el que forman sus vectores normales (tomando el agudo)<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(\\cos\\alpha=\\dfrac{|\\vec n\\cdot\\vec n'|}{|\\vec n|\\,|\\vec n'|}\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\vec n=(1,3,2),\\quad\\vec n'=(-2,1,3),\\quad\\cos\\alpha=\\frac{|-2+3+6|}{\\sqrt{14}\\,\\sqrt{14}}=\\frac7{14}=\\frac12\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\alpha=60^\\circ\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Cortes de \\(\\pi\\) con los ejes: \\(A(5,0,0)\\), \\(B\\left(0,\\frac53,0\\right)\\), \\(C\\left(0,0,\\frac52\\right)\\). Las tres aristas desde \\(O\\) son perpendiculares, así que tomo como base el triángulo rectángulo \\(OAB\\) y como altura \\(OC\\):</p>\\[V=\\frac13\\cdot\\frac{5\\cdot\\frac53}2\\cdot\\frac52=\\frac{125}{36}\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":69,\"el\":30,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[5,0,0],[0,1.667,0],[0,0,2.5]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[5,0,0],\"#64748b\",1.2,true],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0,1.667,0],\"#64748b\",1.2,true],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[0,0,2.5],\"#64748b\",1.2,true],[\"pt\",[5,0,0],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,1.667,0],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,0,2.5],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,0,0],\"O\",-14,12]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 239' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m15r6a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m15r6a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m15r6a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m15r6a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='26.0,185.4 314.0,179.0 281.3,18.0' fill='#f59e0b' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#b45309' stroke-width='1.2'/><line x1='281.3' y1='136.4' x2='26.0' y2='185.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='281.3' y1='136.4' x2='314.0' y2='179.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='281.3' y1='136.4' x2='281.3' y2='18.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><circle cx='26.0' cy='185.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='33.0' y='179.4' font-weight='700'>A</text><circle cx='314.0' cy='179.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='321.0' y='173.0' font-weight='700'>B</text><circle cx='281.3' cy='18.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='288.3' y='12.0' font-weight='700'>C</text><circle cx='281.3' cy='136.4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='267.3' y='148.4' font-weight='700'>O</text><line x1='24' y1='209' x2='9.1' y2='211.9' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='0.8' y='216.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='209' x2='29.7' y2='216.5' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='28.7' y='223.1' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='209' x2='24.0' y2='195.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='194.3' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,231)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,231)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(V=\\dfrac{125}{36}\\approx3{,}47\\ u^3\\)</div></div>"
