  {
   "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-6-5",
   "n": 5,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=(x^2+3x+1)e^{-x}\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Estudia y calcula las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1 p.) Halla los puntos de la gráfica de \\(f\\) cuya recta tangente es horizontal.",
     "(0,5 p.) Determina la ecuación de la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=0\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Verticales:</b> no hay, porque \\(f\\) es continua en \\(\\mathbb R\\).</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{x^2+3x+1}{e^x}=\\left[\\frac\\infty\\infty\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{2x+3}{e^x}\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac2{e^x}=0\\]<p>\\(y=0\\) es asíntota horizontal en \\(+\\infty\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>.</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}(x^2+3x+1)e^{-x}=(+\\infty)(+\\infty)=+\\infty,\\qquad m=\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{f(x)}x=\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\left(x+3+\\frac1x\\right)e^{-x}=-\\infty\\]<p>En \\(-\\infty\\) no hay asíntota horizontal ni oblicua.</p><div class='res'>Única asíntota: \\(y=0\\) en \\(+\\infty\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La tangente es horizontal donde \\(f'(x)=0\\):</p>\\[f'(x)=(2x+3)e^{-x}-(x^2+3x+1)e^{-x}=(-x^2-x+2)e^{-x}=-(x+2)(x-1)e^{-x}\\]\\[f'(x)=0\\iff x=-2\\ \\text{ o }\\ x=1\\qquad f(-2)=(4-6+1)e^2=-e^2,\\quad f(1)=\\frac5e\\]<div class='res'>\\((-2,-e^2)\\) y \\(\\left(1,\\dfrac5e\\right)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f(0)=1\\) y \\(f'(0)=2\\cdot1=2\\):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='30.9,-418.0 33.0,-301.3 35.1,-202.8 37.2,-120.1 39.2,-51.2 41.3,5.8 43.4,52.3 45.5,89.9 47.6,119.8 49.6,143.0 51.7,160.5 53.8,173.3 55.9,181.9 57.9,187.2 60.0,189.5 62.1,189.6 64.2,187.7 66.2,184.2 68.3,179.6 70.4,173.9 72.5,167.6 74.5,160.7 76.6,153.5 78.7,146.2 80.8,138.7 82.8,131.3 84.9,123.9 87.0,116.8 89.1,109.9 91.1,103.2 93.2,96.9 95.3,90.9 97.4,85.2 99.4,79.9 101.5,74.9 103.6,70.3 105.7,66.0 107.7,62.1 109.8,58.5 111.9,55.3 114.0,52.3 116.0,49.7 118.1,47.3 120.2,45.3 122.3,43.4 124.3,41.9 126.4,40.5 128.5,39.3 130.6,38.4 132.6,37.6 134.7,37.0 136.8,36.6 138.9,36.3 140.9,36.1 143.0,36.0 145.1,36.1 147.2,36.2 149.2,36.4 151.3,36.7 153.4,37.1 155.5,37.5 157.5,38.0 159.6,38.5 161.7,39.1 163.8,39.7 165.9,40.4 167.9,41.0 170.0,41.7 172.1,42.4 174.2,43.1 176.2,43.8 178.3,44.5 180.4,45.2 182.5,45.9 184.5,46.6 186.6,47.3 188.7,48.0 190.8,48.7 192.8,49.3 194.9,50.0 197.0,50.6 199.1,51.3 201.1,51.9 203.2,52.5 205.3,53.0 207.4,53.6 209.4,54.2 211.5,54.7 213.6,55.2 215.7,55.7 217.7,56.2 219.8,56.7 221.9,57.1 224.0,57.5 226.0,58.0 228.1,58.4 230.2,58.8 232.3,59.1 234.3,59.5 236.4,59.8 238.5,60.2 240.6,60.5 242.6,60.8 244.7,61.1 246.8,61.3 248.9,61.6 250.9,61.9 253.0,62.1 255.1,62.3 257.2,62.6 259.2,62.8 261.3,63.0 263.4,63.2 265.5,63.3 267.5,63.5 269.6,63.7 271.7,63.8 273.8,64.0 275.8,64.1 277.9,64.3 280.0,64.4' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='74.7,100.0 113.1,53.3 151.4,6.7' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='61.1' cy='189.8' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='67.1' y='195.8'>(−2, −e²)</text><circle cx='143.2' cy='36.0' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='147.2' y='30.0'>(1, 5/e)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 66.7H294.0M115.8 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='61.1' y1='63.7' x2='61.1' y2='69.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='58.1' y='80.7' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='170.5' y1='63.7' x2='170.5' y2='69.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='167.5' y='80.7' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='225.3' y1='63.7' x2='225.3' y2='69.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='222.3' y='80.7' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='280.0' y1='63.7' x2='280.0' y2='69.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='277.0' y='80.7' font-size='10'>6</text><line x1='112.8' y1='166.7' x2='118.8' y2='166.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='99.8' y='170.7' font-size='10'>-6</text><line x1='112.8' y1='116.7' x2='118.8' y2='116.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='99.8' y='120.7' font-size='10'>-3</text><line x1='112.8' y1='33.3' x2='118.8' y2='33.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='99.8' y='37.3' font-size='10'>2</text></svg></div><div class='res'>\\(y=2x+1\\)</div></div>"
    }
