  {
   "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-6-7",
   "n": 7,
   "num": 3,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el siguiente sistema de ecuaciones \\[\\begin{cases}x+\\alpha z=2\\\\2x+\\alpha y=\\alpha+4\\\\3x+y+(\\alpha+4)z=7\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,75 p.) Discute el sistema según los valores de \\(\\alpha\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Resuelve el sistema para \\(\\alpha=2\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&\\alpha\\\\2&\\alpha&0\\\\3&1&\\alpha+4\\end{pmatrix}\\qquad A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&0&\\alpha&2\\\\2&\\alpha&0&\\alpha+4\\\\3&1&\\alpha+4&7\\end{array}\\right)\\]<p>Uso el teorema de Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>Rouché-Frobenius: el sistema es compatible si y solo si \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\); determinado si ese rango es el número de incógnitas, indeterminado si es menor.</i>. Calculo \\(|A|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|A|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&\\alpha\\\\2&\\alpha&0\\\\3&1&\\alpha+4\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(\\alpha^{2} + 4 \\alpha+0+2 \\alpha\\bigr)-\\bigl(3 \\alpha^{2}+0+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=-2\\alpha^2+6\\alpha=-2\\alpha(\\alpha-3)\\]\\[|A|=0\\iff\\boxed{\\alpha=0}\\ \\text{ o }\\ \\boxed{\\alpha=3}\\]<p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\alpha\\neq0,3\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=3=\\operatorname{rg}A^*\\). <b>Compatible determinado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\alpha=0\\)<b>:</b> \\(A^*=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1&0&0&2\\\\2&0&0&4\\\\3&1&4&7\\end{array}\\right)\\). La segunda fila es el doble de la primera y \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&0\\\\3&1\\end{vmatrix}=1\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2\\). <b>Compatible indeterminado.</b></p><p><b>• Si </b>\\(\\alpha=3\\)<b>:</b> \\(\\begin{vmatrix}1&0\\\\2&3\\end{vmatrix}=3\\neq0\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}A=2\\). Menor de \\(A^*\\) de las columnas 1, 2 y 4:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}1&0&2\\\\2&3&7\\\\3&1&7\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(21+0+4\\bigr)-\\bigl(18+7+0\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}A^*=2=\\operatorname{rg}A\\). <b>Compatible indeterminado.</b></p><div class='res'>Si \\(\\alpha\\neq0,3\\): compatible determinado. Si \\(\\alpha=0\\) o \\(\\alpha=3\\): compatible indeterminado</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(\\alpha=2\\) es compatible determinado:</p>\\[\\begin{cases}x+2z=2\\\\2x+2y=6\\\\3x+y+6z=7\\end{cases}\\]<p>De la 1.ª, \\(x=2-2z\\); de la 2.ª, \\(y=3-x=1+2z\\). En la 3.ª: \\(6-6z+1+2z+6z=7\\iff2z=0\\iff z=0\\). Entonces \\(x=2\\), \\(y=1\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(x=2,\\ y=1,\\ z=0\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "sistemas",
     "tipo": "disc",
     "apartados": "a"
