   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean el punto \\(P(1,6,-2)\\) y la recta \\(r\\equiv\\dfrac{x-5}6=\\dfrac{y+1}{-3}=\\dfrac z2\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Halla la ecuación general del plano \\(\\pi\\) que contiene al punto \\(P\\) y a la recta \\(r\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Calcula la distancia entre el punto \\(P\\) y la recta \\(r\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\(R(5,-1,0)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(6,-3,2)\\). El plano contiene a \\(\\vec d\\) y a \\(\\overrightarrow{RP}=(-4,7,-2)\\):</p>\\[\\vec n=\\vec d\\times\\overrightarrow{RP}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\6&-3&2\\\\-4&7&-2\\end{vmatrix}=(-8,\\,4,\\,30)\\parallel(-4,2,15)\\]<p>Es de la forma \\(-4x+2y+15z+D=0\\) y contiene a \\(R\\): \\(-20-2+D=0\\iff D=22\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(\\pi\\equiv-4x+2y+15z+22=0\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación con \\(P\\): \\(-4+12-30+22=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Proyecto \\(P\\) sobre \\(r\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>El camino más corto de un punto a una recta es el segmento perpendicular a la recta.</i>.</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a </b>\\(r\\)<b> por </b>\\(P\\)<b>:</b> \\(6x-3y+2z+D=0\\), con \\(P\\): \\(6-18-4+D=0\\iff D=16\\).</p><p><b>Paso 2. Corte con </b>\\(r\\) \\((5+6t,\\,-1-3t,\\,2t)\\):</p>\\[6(5+6t)-3(-1-3t)+2\\cdot2t+16=0\\iff49t+49=0\\iff t=-1\\Rightarrow M(-1,2,-2)\\]<p><b>Paso 3. Distancia:</b></p>\\[d(P,r)=|\\overrightarrow{PM}|=|(-2,-4,0)|=\\sqrt{20}=2\\sqrt5\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":144,\"el\":68,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[5.58,-1.574,0.231],[5.58,6.755,-0.879],[-1.58,6.505,-2.755],[-1.58,-1.825,-1.645]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-1.58,6.505,-2.755],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"line\",[-4.6,3.8,-3.2],[6.8,-1.9,0.6],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[6.8,-1.9,0.6],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[2.6,0.2,-0.8],[3.8,-0.4,-0.4],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"line\",[1,6,-2],[-1,2,-2],\"#16a34a\",2.0,true],[\"line\",[-0.776,2.447,-2.0],[-0.348,2.233,-1.857],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-0.348,2.233,-1.857],[-0.571,1.786,-1.857],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[1,6,-2],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1,2,-2],\"M\",8,12]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m15r6b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m15r6b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m15r6b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m15r6b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='143.4,39.4 26.0,125.8 102.9,229.3 220.3,142.9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='106.9' y='229.3' fill='#7c3aed' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>π</text><line x1='172.0' y1='246.0' x2='135.5' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='141.5' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='149.0' y1='102.0' x2='145.1' y2='78.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m15r6b4d)'/><text x='149.1' y='74.0' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='83.6' y1='185.8' x2='160.5' y2='174.0' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.0' stroke-dasharray='4 3'/><line x1='151.9' y1='175.3' x2='150.5' y2='166.8' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='150.5' y1='166.8' x2='159.1' y2='165.4' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='83.6' cy='185.8' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='90.6' y='179.8' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='160.5' cy='174.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='168.5' y='186.0' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='14.6' y2='258.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='8.3' y='257.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='11.1' y2='278.7' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='3.5' y='285.8' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='264.0' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='265.9' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><rect x='0' y='-8' width='12' height='9' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.4' stroke='#7c3aed'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>plano</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(157.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y